what: knowledge-gym 05_noresults_honesty passes. The reasoning loop
  (Executor::execute_reason_with_tools) appends one note under a tool result
  that ran and came back empty (tool_loop::result_cardinality == 0): the
  source does not hold it, do not search again with other words, answer and
  say it is missing. Census: the gym's executor path is byte-identical to
  main 18f783f44 (executor.rs, tool_loop.rs, the tool description), so this
  is not a cut regression. The second lookup came from the loop prompt's
  "If results are incomplete, try different terms" outranking the tool's own
  "Empty evidence -> say I don't know". Each traced replay rephrased into the
  same empty envelope.
checks: CLEAN exit=0; LINT exit=0; TEST(sovereign-core) exit=0 1550/0;
  LAYER exit=0; BOUNDARY exit=0 (clone-gate 13804, baseline 13820);
  PLANT red (reason_with_tools_states_an_empty_result_as_absent FAIL with the
  note removed), green restored.
evidence: deployed daemon, primary, n=3x3: HEAD loop 05 0/9 (2 lookups each);
  system-prompt rule only 7/9; note under the result 05 9/9, 01 9/9, 06 9/9.
  The lane runs `sovereign-cli-llm-stock` (package sovereign-stock), which
  needs a rebuild before the next quality check reads this.
